#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:5 803855b74bd54b24b9058161d6d65ced
msgid "RC Input Channel Mapping (RCMAP)"
msgstr "RC 输入通道映射（RCMAP）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:7 6457ed6296cf4c28b08328f6ac75d93f
msgid ""
"This article shows how to set up a non-standard RC input channel mapping "
"using the RCMAP feature."
msgstr "本文介绍如何使用 RCMAP 功能设置非标准 RC 输入通道映射。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:11 c06b57cc9c8644a5935447a9d637e5ba
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:13 d1de2f75896e4e1e956e2871e773fa65
msgid "By default the RC input channels are:"
msgstr "默认情况下，RC 输入通道为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:16 63edb83d850d4c1ba3d65c26065fb6c4
msgid "Channel 1: Roll input"
msgstr "通道1：横滚输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:17 a9769d21de5a407f8014b654039817c1
msgid "Channel 2: Pitch input"
msgstr "通道2：俯仰输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:18 938cc71073954882a247c8f264eec563
msgid "Channel 3: Throttle input"
msgstr "通道3：油门输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:19 b879e4dd517a4dcfa2a95b5ed752b48b
msgid "Channel 4: Yaw input"
msgstr "通道4：偏航输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:22 d55e7e7e2c5c4be3956a74645b306ff6
msgid ""
"These can be changed by setting the  :ref:`RCMAP_ROLL <RCMAP_ROLL>`, "
":ref:`RCMAP_PITCH <RCMAP_PITCH>`, :ref:`RCMAP_THROTTLE <RCMAP_THROTTLE>` and"
" :ref:`RCMAP_YAW <RCMAP_YAW>` parameters using the *Mission Planner*'s "
"**Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter Tree** (or Full Parameter List) as shown "
"below."
msgstr ""
"可通过使用 *Mission Planner* 的 **Config/Tuning \\| Full Parameter Tree**（或 Full "
"Parameter List）设置 :ref:`RCMAP_ROLL <RCMAP_ROLL>`、:ref:`RCMAP_PITCH "
"<RCMAP_PITCH>`、:ref:`RCMAP_THROTTLE <RCMAP_THROTTLE>` 和 :ref:`RCMAP_YAW "
"<RCMAP_YAW>` 参数来更改这些映射，如下所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:27 b7bb31fb81ef45fabf054f54354d2e40
msgid ""
"After changing any of these parameters the autopilot should be rebooted."
msgstr "修改上述任何参数后，应重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:32 3e49a18e726642ebae3da5d08c678ee0
msgid ""
"Additional information about the ``RCMAP`` parameters can be found in the "
":ref:`Parameters <rover:RCMAP_ROLL>` reference."
msgstr "有关 ``RCMAP`` 参数的更多信息，请参阅 :ref:`参数 <rover:RCMAP_ROLL>` 参考文档。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:37 6f1a21cce58d4a06b2422f54e1990d9b
msgid "Rover notes"
msgstr "Rover 说明"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:39 fc59bb0dec61469dbbc33d67174f0c9e
msgid ""
"As a real example, if your aileron (steering) is on channel 1 and your "
"elevator (throttle) is on channel 2, then the settings should be:"
msgstr "举个实际例子，如果您的副翼（转向）在通道 1，升降舵（油门）在通道 2，则设置应为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:42 0e5f4b4a066f416bb4d526060fe1541d
msgid "``RCMAP_ROLL=1``"
msgstr "``RCMAP_ROLL=1``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:43 c49321621db8445c809a30c5456f4694
msgid "``RCMAP_THROTTLE=2``"
msgstr "``RCMAP_THROTTLE=2``"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:45 9cad19f2e8f1448ea84d6a2efb3cef1b
msgid ""
"``RCMAP_PITCH`` and ``RCMAP_YAW`` can be whatever channels you want to make "
"them as long as they are not channels 1 and 2."
msgstr "``RCMAP_PITCH`` 和 ``RCMAP_YAW`` 可以设置为任意通道，只要不是通道 1 和 2 即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcmap.rst:48 0ad3f620dced4bbfab2f05876bd6f309
msgid ""
"For Rover you should also select the receiver channel that will be used to "
"control the Mode select (:ref:`MODE_CH <rover:MODE_CH>`)."
msgstr "对于 Rover，还应选择用于控制模式切换的接收器通道（:ref:`MODE_CH <rover:MODE_CH>`）。"

